      "content": "it's not just the noise though. it's like everything feels empty and fake. people keep telling me \"it was just a dog\" or \"you can get another one\" but they don't get it. he was the only thing that was actually real in my life. now that he's gone, it just feels like i'm going through the motions for no reason. like i'm just a ghost in this house.",
